WEBVTT

00:00:59.931 --> 00:01:02.600
from the beginning of 
the Green Revolution,

00:01:02.600 --> 00:01:05.186
it has grown nearly 30 fold.

00:01:05.895 --> 00:01:08.731
From five million metric tons

00:01:08.773 --> 00:01:11.275
at the beginning of 
the Green Revolution,

00:01:11.317 --> 00:01:13.778
to 150 million metric tons,

00:01:13.820 --> 00:01:15.279
what we are currently using.

00:01:15.947 --> 00:01:21.327
A 30-fold increase in nitrogen
fertilizer consumption

00:01:21.369 --> 00:01:27.083
has resulted in a four-fold increase
in global food grain production.

00:01:28.459 --> 00:01:30.962
